Generate SSH key pairs (Ed25519, ECDSA, RSA) on the SSH Key form and show the public key. Requires paramiko 5.1.0 or later: upgrade it before updating the module, or the update fails with "External dependency version mismatch". paramiko 5 drops SHA-1 key exchange, SHA-1 RSA signatures (`ssh-rsa`) and group-exchange moduli below 2048 bits, so servers that offer only these must be updated (for example, to Ed25519 keys or SHA-2 algorithms) before Tower can connect to them.
